# Safety net: never publish these to the public dataset mirror.
# Semi-supervised label masks and train/test splits are regenerated at runtime
# per seed (see README "Reproducing the experimental protocol"), and the FCM /
# raw-ESA products are the circular ground truth rejected in revision R1.
*_FCM_*
*_labeled_*pct.*
*_groundtruth_esa_raw.tif
*_NDVI.tif

# Stray build/artifact files that must never land in the data repo.
*.pdf
